Conflicts: saa716x, saa716x-legacy-dkms, saa716x+firmware-dkms
Description: DKMS support for SAA716x DVB devices
 This package provides the out-of-tree SAA716x driver sources
 for building the SAA716x kernel modules with DKMS.
 .
 The package contains all required DVB frontend and tuner
 headers.
